& [SelectedFormation]
  + [working_name] Cantor Self Work Update Handoff Admission P0
  + [sequence_name] SWA-04A
  + [purpose] purely bind one exact SWA-03 ready lifecycle step to one supplied prior Phase3A candidate-workspace admission identity and one bounded update proposal awaiting physical revalidation
  + [output] one deterministic handoff proposal or one typed refusal with no process or filesystem action

& [RequiredInputs]
  + complete validated SelfWorkLifecycleRequest and current SelfWorkLifecycleCheckpoint
  + one exact ready_awaiting_admission step and its current attempt identity
  + one complete prior CandidateWorkspaceRequest and AdmissionReceipt with exact nonce candidate correlation base branch and allowed paths
  + one bounded update proposal retaining objective step evidence expected path-change kinds verification obligations rollback intent and unresolved account

& [RequiredCorrespondence]
  + lifecycle plan objective session step attempt checkpoint sequence and digest remain exact
  + admission candidate correlation base branch allowlist request digest and receipt digest remain exact while present freshness is explicitly unresolved
  + every proposed path is canonical relative non-Git-metadata and within the admitted nonoverlapping allowlist
  + proposal disposition remains prepared_awaiting_physical_revalidation and every workspace update capability remains not granted

& [RequiredOutputsAndFaults]
  + strict request handoff and proposal profiles use closed deterministic JSON and domain-separated digests
  + output retains exact predecessor identities bounded evidence future physical broker requirement and explicit nonauthority
  + profile lifecycle workspace freshness candidate path proposal evidence bound authority correspondence digest and machine-form faults are typed
  + unknown fields stale admission nonready step attempt substitution path widening receipt laundering and digest mutation refuse atomically

& [Delineation]
  + exact pure validation correspondence proposal identity machine forms and deterministic replay are inside
  + acquiring current filesystem state issuing Phase3A receipt process launch workspace mutation App Server runtime event interpretation verification performance acceptance rollback cleanup commit push provider SOP authorship signature activation persistence remote FPGA and Minecraft are outside

& [SJSReadiness]
  + source explicitly authorizes SJS contract formation and all selected inputs have tracked definitions
  + the five relevant locally generated App Server schemas match their pinned tracked identities but SWA-04A does not consume or authorize the App Server
  + the formation must reuse existing validation APIs and may not duplicate or weaken SWA-03 Phase3A or Phase3 machine-form semantics
  + [required_crate] cantor_ecosystem because it already depends on cantor_core and owns CandidateWorkspaceRequest AdmissionReceipt and Phase3 evidence forms
  + cantor_core cannot consume cantor_ecosystem workspace types without reversing the existing dependency and creating an invalid cycle
  + current Phase3A validate_request performs filesystem executable hashing and canonicalization I/O and therefore cannot be called by SWA-04A
  + current request and receipt digest-forming helpers are private; SJS must explicitly admit a narrow internal effect-free shape and digest verifier extraction without changing the proven physical producer
  + that verifier can prove supplied-form integrity and correspondence but never present filesystem freshness
  + [recommended_scope] one pure cantor_ecosystem workspace_admission child module one internal verifier extraction one public export one focused target and no dependency runtime CLI MCP or effect delta
  + [status] ready_for_seven_fold_explosion_data_design_matrix_plan_phase_lock_and_satisfaction_signature
  + [implementation_authority] absent

& [DeferredFormation]
  + SWA-04B physical writer broker must call the existing physical revalidate_candidate_workspace immediately before launch and requires separately preserved current executable and target-host evidence renewed SJS authority exact event/runtime profiles and the existing physical proof matrix
  + applied verified accepted refused quarantined and rolled-back receipts belong to SWA-04B or a later separately delineated verifier contract and must not be fabricated by SWA-04A
